# This repo is scoped to the mt5_bot project only. The parent folder also
# holds many unrelated personal projects (open-webui, siparişler, driver_cam,
# completer, urun_agaci*, po_mcp, whatsapp_bot, etc.) that were never meant to
# be tracked here -- without this deny-by-default block, VS Code/git treat
# every file in all of them as untracked (open-webui alone is ~53,000 files).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/mt5_bot/
!/start_mt5_bot.bat
!/start_excel_mcp.bat
!/start_po_pipeline.bat

# Secrets -- real MT5/API credentials, never commit
mt5_bot/local_settings.py

# Generated logs, caches, and run output -- never worth committing
*.log
__pycache__/
.webui_secret_key
/backtest_results/
/backtest_results_rf10/
/finetune_data/
